# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides. `.env.local` is git-ignored — never commit real values.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle, and anything
# exposed that way is PUBLIC. Never put secrets or private API keys in a VITE_ variable.
#
# The app itself needs no environment variables. The two below are read only by the server
# function `api/slip.ts` (the "Launch slipped?" assistant) on Vercel. Without them the assistant
# says it is unavailable and the Mission form does the job by hand.

# Google Gemini API key (free tier). SERVER ONLY: set it in Vercel's project settings
# (Environment Variables), never with a VITE_ prefix. `npm run build` fails if it appears in dist/.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: the Gemini model. Defaults to gemini-3.6-flash when empty.
GEMINI_MODEL=
